        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present to the market this perfect blank canvas three bedroom semi-detached property ideally situated in Charnwood Grove. Charnwood is a mature and highly sought after development located just on the outskirts of Clonsilla village which offers a large variety of local amenities including schools, shops, cafes, bars and recreational facilities. Transport wise, you have a choice of Clonsilla and Coolmine train stations and you are well positioned with access to the N3 and M50 road networks whilst public transport routes can be found at the entrance to the development. Blanchardstown shopping centre is situated c. 2km away and the Phoenix Park a 10 minute drive!\r\n\r\nBright & spacious internal living accommodation of c. 100 sq m comprises entrance hallway, downstairs WC, lounge to the front with a spacious kitchen/dining room to the rear. Upstairs consists of three bedrooms (one with ensuite) and main family bathroom. The front boasts off street parking with a low maintenace garden and the rear sunny garden with Eastern Orientation can be accessed through the side entrance. Number 19 comes to the market in great condition as the perfect blank canvas home for it's new owners. This one is absolutely ideal for first time buyers looking to step onto the property or those looking to trade up. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on  01 554 1699 for further information.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n- Blank Canvas Family home\r\n- 3 Bed/3 Bath\r\n- Semi-detached home with side entrance\r\n- Vacant with no onward chain\r\n- Freshly painted and refereshed for it's new owners\r\n- c. 100 sq m\r\n- BER C\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Off street parking to front\r\n- Low maintenance front graden\r\n- Sunny rear orientation with East Facing\r\n- Prime for first time buyers & those trading up\r\n- Quiet cul de sac\r\n- Fantastic location in a mature & sought out development\r\n- Blanchardstown shopping Centre 2km\r\n-Clonsilla & Coolmine Train stations within easy reach\r\n- Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n\r\nEircode = D15 A2K6"
      },
